# Agentic state of this project: session memory (.context/) and the plan kanban (plan/) are
# versioned ON PURPOSE. The cloud agent (GitHub Actions, label `agent:run`) checks the repo out
# on a runner, reads the memory files, adopts the issue into plan/draft, moves it to plan/qa and
# commits it: anything outside the checkout is invisible to it. The old local-junction layout
# (state in ../.context and ../plan) was retired on 2026-10-20. Only the telemetry sinks stay
# untracked, and nothing may add an exception for them.
.context/comprehension-log.md
.context/research-dataset.jsonl

# Local install output of `./install.sh project` — the opencode2 development tree
# (agent/command/skill copies, context, local model profile, node_modules).
# Regenerated locally; never committed. Holds a local API key in opencode.jsonc.
# Exception: ci-check.md is shown to CI agents by the agent workflow and must be committed.
# NOTE: exclude the children (".opencode/*"), not the directory itself (".opencode/"):
# a directory exclusion prevents git from even descending inside it, so a negation
# like "!.opencode/ci-check.md" would never match.
.opencode/*
!.opencode/ci-check.md

# Hermes agent local state (plan-mode drafts, scratch notes).
.hermes/
